<body>
    <h1>Local User Login in IGEL OS 12</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>This article shows how to configure the local login authenticati=
on in IGEL OS.</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>If several login methods are enabled, the login method can be selected o=
n the&nbsp;login&nbsp;screen.</p>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<p>Menu path:<strong>&nbsp;Security &gt; Logon &gt; Local User</strong></p>
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image con=
fluence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"b13e6b373ae60abee5a36be90bc24dfbeb1734bd4d02e3988520952a818bb338" data-=
image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/7330=
2193/OS12.2_Logon_Local%20User.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D17163=
64680651&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"635" data-width=
=3D"1117" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73=
308920" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"att=
achment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"OS12.2_Logon_Local User.png"=
 data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resourc=
e-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302193"=
 data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" data-media-id=3D"9895d199-b78=
b-4bdb-bb6d-7a4a5718b864" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"265"></span>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Login with local user password</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 Upon the start of the device, a login screen is shown and auth=
entication with a local user password is required. The password specified u=
nder <strong>Password</strong>&nbsp;is deployed to log in.</p>
<p>=E2=98=90 No authentication is required <span class=3D"legacy-color-text=
-blue3">upon device startup</span>. (Default)</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Password</strong></p>
<p>The password deployed to log in. This password is also required for unlo=
cking the screen if the <strong>Require password to unlock (screenlock)</st=
rong> option is enabled under <strong>User Interface &gt; Screenlock / Scre=
ensaver &gt; Options</strong>. For more information, see <a href=3D"https:/=
/igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302255/Screenlo=
ck+Screensaver+Options+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73302255" =
data-linked-resource-version=3D"8" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Scree=
nloock/Screensaver Options in IGEL OS 12</a> .<br></p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>If the login method is configured and the <strong>Allow system logoff</s=
trong> option is enabled under <strong>System &gt; Power Options &gt; Shutd=
own</strong>, the user can log off the device through the shutdown menu. Fo=
r information on how to access the shutdown menu, see <a href=3D"https://ig=
el-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302824/Commands+Se=
ssion+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73302824" data-linked-resou=
rce-version=3D"8" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Commands Session in IG=
EL OS 12</a> . For information on how to configure the shutdown menu, see <=
a href=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/=
73302742/Shutdown+Settings+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"733027=
42" data-linked-resource-version=3D"4" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">S=
hutdown Settings in IGEL OS 12</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
